  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 302.01 Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 302.01 “Application” means the department's standard form or the EPA standard national form for applying for a permit, the information provided on and with the form, and the fee associated with the application, as applicable.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Hw 300) #9362, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12345, eff 8-14-17",
